('Reinhardt', 'tank', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/551fbe070c16fdfcc17f7f1de63af22c53e7d2f1340fc2f3172441504527bc4e.png', 'Reinhardt Wilhelm styles himself as a champion of a bygone age, who lives by the knightly codes of valor, justice, and courage.', '[{\"name\":\"Rocket Hammer\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/22c800a8529b46a64f391cd432c94023dca2745ef9c9eec52ad9a7843d7df4e5.png\"},{\"name\":\"Charge\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/6b7b226ab508dc7a45908b0613dc889558cf2cc217c04d072940e0a539ac56aa.png\"},{\"name\":\"Fire Strike\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/ca90071b2e0c9cbf5a6e91e580682c73456298b88e34d40d7bf5eb5c098173a1.png\"},{\"name\":\"Barrier Field\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/423dec435587464e24a663cdd4f35178020854e1f924af5902eebba5be9607f2.png\"},{\"name\":\"Earthshatter\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/c5c5d0db3af35de00d60dd68e6350a540febbbac094bafaf0663f25ae4dcfd2b.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltbbe906442602f70b/631a8b03a633280e74dc25c1/2600_Reinhardt.jpg', 34, '[\"King\'s Row\",\"Eichenwalde\",\"Midtown\"]'),
('Roadhog', 'tank', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/89ddf07e4b619ed96169042e296a1b8856d102746f35add88284b44a9a5a6a03.png', 'Roadhog is a powerful enforcer with a well-earned reputation for random and wanton destruction.', '[{\"name\":\"Scrap Gun\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/d48d0b264d765e3732abda784e986595f7a6c5ad0e56f1929c008ffc0492a39d.png\"},{\"name\":\"Chain Hook\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/7edc1cdef13c2fd21e279043816aa1d2975dc784298502fd121b927729e1e86d.png\"},{\"name\":\"Take a Breather\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/064bde1e9f9f65e2a1ca0898abe09432394dca3b0729da0dcccff41b5f5be69b.png\"},{\"name\":\"Whole Hog\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/907eeb4e179b70ea279ca8dd0e276bf45a1b1a13875757ae3b8fd2305f2affa9.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt53bec63947a5bd1f/631a8ae585af980dae7a2eee/2600_Roadhog.jpg', 35, '[\"Junkertown\",\"Havana\",\"Circuit Royal\"]'),
('Sierra', 'damage', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/4bfd3d8b95844231115cb5bf4db03344c71bc3e865189c52403b2dc51438e63a.png', 'A dedicated teammate with enhanced abilities, Sierra has climbed the ranks of Helix Security. With her positive attitude, there\'s no challenge she can\'t face.', '[{\"name\":\"Helix Rifle\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/d12e2bc19f1619b71d13816c01ef96ad54bb6a7cb4ee00ae8bea8be3d2e2102d.png\"},{\"name\":\"Tracking Shot\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/6c77d58daaeaae211088786b8bf9bff92178ef2df3f0ca6ec9a721d6b4258e55.png\"},{\"name\":\"Tremor Charge\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/f4b141af6f5e6b6c392cdde07083f29d1b5374303c7fc39e37c3f4ed51985e52.png\"},{\"name\":\"Anchor Drone\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/f9e6fff99bff3c24a9ea9e57ae7c71b067982e6df9b0acb50529fe58131b6e7b.png\"},{\"name\":\"Trailblazer\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/4a300c381bac87785f406965cf94ef8d75ee2592bb07d867d50d1c738d8312c8.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltbfeb25b49ede0408/69d6dab0ffc7dd7d06813993/2600_Sierra.png', 36, NULL),
('Sigma', 'tank', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/a4c032fa466c9a6d9c6974747635d7ef910027f91cd58892af0c899db565f92d.png', 'Brilliant astrophysicist Dr. Siebren de Kuiper\'s life changed forever when an experiment gone wrong gave him the ability to control gravity; now, Talon manipulates him to their own ends.', '[{\"name\":\"Hyperspheres\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/30fc5dd8efdcc6aa5a34191c3ff308fb77fdfd542b2bfc36e1536f0db7bdb618.png\"},{\"name\":\"Kinetic Grasp\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/c8af801acf16c796c38a8aa8abb571eda481d6490f0562105aa20f319cccdf41.png\"},{\"name\":\"Accretion\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/f7fd30ad038cc989f39b28bac6744b6ab0215e9817adfd67d077f3b40bc10fdf.png\"},{\"name\":\"Experimental Barrier\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/2ad5aa270071c229fd0a83b49d0ebd6b502489f0a0b5bcb109140eea79a5fb6b.png\"},{\"name\":\"Gravitic Flux\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/0a5cda51d0e802e9adbdedefee7461c5abe2b6c6a7027d55903ac9a28281b2e4.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltcd6803238893c4ee/631a8adb6d5f7a0df8d92790/2600_Sigma.jpg', 37, '[\"Colosseo\",\"Esperan\\u00e7a\",\"Ilios\"]'),
('Sojourn', 'damage', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/82b8c1b8765dcb9a0ba16e343c3516bf324c771ac81e9878473280216e70a889.png', 'As a leader in the bygone days of Overwatch, Vivian Chase, callsign Sojourn, is determined to ensure its new heroes don’t repeat the mistakes of the past.', '[{\"name\":\"Railgun\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/e5b9de0193dfaf675dd1cd1cbfe4ac96c8cc62059b376a728da56f59f639ee25.png\"},{\"name\":\"Power Slide\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/96315794f51b0dd88c540803fc3930472d75dca3cf00c02ad89dda1b0551493c.png\"},{\"name\":\"Disruptor Shot\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/aeee6090d3c14383487584bda86043add0b69c02331ad01dfd01958a545dddcf.png\"},{\"name\":\"Overclock\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/5772b79f0a9d28125abb69412bce2a025d79f9b6023b561427592ece2b761588.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt074d60a0c1b22e57/631a8ad3a633280e74dc25b9/2600_Sojourn.jpg', 38, '[\"Circuit Royal\",\"Midtown\",\"Havana\"]');
INSERT INTO `heroes` (`name`, `role`, `portrait`, `description`, `abilities`, `screenshot`, `heroID`, `best_maps`) VALUES
('Soldier: 76', 'damage', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/c93b5f0a528c40473188f77cc2a267aee7d5b6cf5c9e104105d634b4388674e2.png', 'The target of an international manhunt, the vigilante known as Soldier: 76 wages a personal war to expose the truth behind Overwatch\'s collapse.', '[{\"name\":\"Heavy Pulse Rifle\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/92a278e67041e7d4fa9b1a392a0a632ae61878b166c07bfa4486fc8f331542c5.png\"},{\"name\":\"Sprint\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/5b9ad6138762e898cd82c4d4573580004ee603976b7cd8e18362c902a00b496e.png\"},{\"name\":\"Biotic Field\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/a7ff449a9b1d26894358265bedbe1f6cbb75707359f9b5b86266e2ce5d1aa3a3.png\"},{\"name\":\"Helix Rockets\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/4b430bbf1650e264875441dab1f4bd1083d106375fc1a7ef0e0c88e1d7371bc4.png\"},{\"name\":\"Tactical Visor\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/be3396e23ba0199441cfa6f3b1ed92400031c662b933c2354288111070210e6f.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt1fdfbf1c51e0c05d/631a8ac9a0ff920e11e791b4/2600_Soldier_76.jpg', 39, '[\"Havana\",\"Circuit Royal\",\"Rialto\"]'),
('Sombra', 'damage', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/47727b02a16e3bd7b2447d86ae1edf11587bc320b2aecb4f2f16a7ca4ad4e8a0.png', 'One of the world\'s most notorious hackers, Sombra uses information to manipulate those in power.', '[{\"name\":\"Machine Pistol\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/5750af901db77f479be41f01c55a5b3d5e644d2f99c179b77bd824eecf5fcbbc.png\"},{\"name\":\"Hack\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/8ab2253eef852a5a038df53fe84ff1dfff0dfea2224bddf881797093695f2261.png\"},{\"name\":\"Translocator\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/13259eeec8db36c3158d1d4bd4fe99667067ee7bf678349eec5cbd0d32da3a7f.png\"},{\"name\":\"Virus\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/2e933c2c42fea37400c5e296cfc9ea1fc2958071b04bde8960c0fa7ca17f3251.png\"},{\"name\":\"EMP\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/9ccf2688b89c3f17c3f6410c3142510ea413718f0d165f78e712184ec636b2e4.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt668912e757ec1b56/631a8ac11566e20e82f30280/2600_Sombra.jpg', 40, '[\"Busan\",\"Numbani\",\"Para\\u00edso\"]'),
('Symmetra', 'damage', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/ebec57e8bd68b3d4383edfeb34f8f52dd0b94a6467d594c2fee722e8a97c32aa.png', 'Symmetra literally bends reality. By manipulating hard-light constructs, she crafts the world as she wishes it to be, in hopes of engineering a perfect society.', '[{\"name\":\"Photon Projector\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/8a4fdf92378cdc77364729fe493013e913d794975c5a9b94865cd740f471d528.png\"},{\"name\":\"Sentry Turret\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/2b4544ab4d75b4499b7cb6b1b6b44e8487b6d3d3857ee119ebbf29d59e903d45.png\"},{\"name\":\"Teleporter\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/1c4fb9dbd9b6d02c2e75c3ad142b79955ba3e6e73469d676c79bdaef7f7a610f.png\"},{\"name\":\"Photon Barrier\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/33e5dd2a53729dad19d77e7528de49e2e3e3a6500657d47fe1c331afd1c0a88f.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt98ba3e34b8d7c3c7/631a8ab9636d390da7825dd3/2600_Symmetra.jpg', 41, '[\"Hanamura\",\"King\'s Row\",\"Eichenwalde\"]'),
('Torbjörn', 'damage', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/ce17118cedc29b0d2ac1e059666bed36b9531c85079b0b894bb402d12c917ba9.png', 'At its height, Overwatch possessed one of the most advanced armaments on the planet, which could be traced to the workshop of an ingenious engineer named Torbjörn Lindholm.', '[{\"name\":\"Rivet Gun\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/2020ce8ffa1d19edbfa7097499ed5763ac18500a0f76cde75cc37243fd6aab27.png\"},{\"name\":\"Forge Hammer\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/f88b11b8a6cceb1ba4a15e3d6bc4beb5a1bce9ae5dbcb088b2d51ace54af13bc.png\"},{\"name\":\"Deploy Turret\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/856576a7a6b8bc93e8024a152a8a300178ed4030c869edebaaf61469cdbc330c.png\"},{\"name\":\"Overload\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/9751ee2ad26041a274f60dab106a3d52eb0f0d7941b4bc48cd14e737e05dc6bd.png\"},{\"name\":\"Molten Core\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/f90a17a62ce6d21dfca5f9dd0df6598f582872f88269c76f51efdec1e198ffe4.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt6704d0e1812cb068/631a8ab1a0ff920e11e791ac/2600_Torbjorn.jpg', 42, '[\"King\'s Row\",\"Eichenwalde\",\"Hanamura\"]'),
('Tracer', 'damage', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/4504f6f15cb3feaa92ecd38e01dcf751cb5abdac2e0bb52d0555727e53277502.png', 'The former Overwatch agent known as Tracer is a time-jumping adventurer and an irrepressible force for good.', '[{\"name\":\"Pulse Pistols\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/17a3bc41fc57a8527c4f44a5615e249acca62cb69319e52b61d499e4e91cf346.png\"},{\"name\":\"Blink\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/b8c86be415dba78af80c8f1536aba583096396327e0609607d21acea6a806276.png\"},{\"name\":\"Recall\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/cfa2264173c1d8a365c514972412fbb802d78cd70451b1d38f37579cea500872.png\"},{\"name\":\"Pulse Bomb\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/a2613e52845b252aee119c75e1b527cd0dd1c6d4c0605b3d48983188268d3581.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt9a87fc6f2249d9c8/631a8aaba633280e74dc25b5/2600_Tracer.jpg', 43, '[\"King\'s Row\",\"Numbani\",\"Busan\"]'),
('Vendetta', 'damage', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/cf8ffb52b6f315546d5e94e9d6defad5a2c570798776956de23f47536f9529da.png', 'As champion of the Colosseo and a member of Italy’s elite, Vendetta will stop at nothing to reclaim the throne of her family’s criminal empire. Known for her explosive rage and ruthlessness in battle, the only thing that exceeds her skill in physical combat is her boundless ambition.', '[{\"name\":\"Palatine Fang\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/9754a770516c07712b3cbababb825972eec78c08b3fbc141dbcee31d9c58c137.png\"},{\"name\":\"Warding Stance\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/fa9a88278d46e3fc49aad27df9a0b70541f16fb517e96711514e7c736c377243.png\"},{\"name\":\"Whirlwind Dash\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/646af7a4d6b6b65adee6543ec70b33c9ffd36989c8dd4e8b22079c6b9e074c79.png\"},{\"name\":\"Soaring Slice\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/785bffa90ccf067fbfd86c7a6d6729ed12566a02554f28d76974b573d3a5c6a0.png\"},{\"name\":\"Projected Edge\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/82d88959c1044cf01449e6909cb962590a6ff4a188565f367a5b8a3b3a038ccb.png\"},{\"name\":\"Sundering Blade\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/827e0c55b3d2f335f5950c676f1f52c8668ad33f34ea4c6052c4a122ac005ce8.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt22bd880e78e94c03/692f5b1c6da5309b6107b257/2600_Vendetta.png', 44, NULL),
('Venture', 'damage', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/dcab9123f5f55df22e54d4e797de43c71b917e0149dd059a7fd6136f48464cd0.png', 'A globe-trotting archaeologist and explorer, Venture has a passion for solving history’s mysteries.', '[{\"name\":\"SMART Excavator\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/b2cc1eb839f7e907defe189101077716373a30e6ee17859521ab558a907a7925.png\"},{\"name\":\"Drill Dash\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/dd98f66d96b860803bd144bb4376d236275bf994228de6f9bd7826ec5c4522e6.png\"},{\"name\":\"Burrow\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/725f02ba7e5bba99db26300cdf1d7478e111b2a4049b7fd41b6ef3a4a6cb0e57.png\"},{\"name\":\"Tectonic Shock\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/41ee94ca95e5e7258fc67aa501aa9972c7a828f4df7b578b4eb44e01490e2679.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blte622280f74e18bd7/65e7a10b31e2488e2e63ae8e/2600_Venture.jpg', 45, '[\"Colosseo\",\"Esperan\\u00e7a\",\"New Junk City\"]'),
('Widowmaker', 'damage', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/6e4702b45f196aaf51555cf57327322721f45458b17f5f0643ed008a88378259.png', 'Widowmaker is the perfect assassin: a patient, ruthlessly efficient killer who shows neither emotion nor remorse.', '[{\"name\":\"Widow\'s Kiss\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/da5b161187088a765de4a40df65e8737bd9b6b09c896c9cc960f8fa322a78f22.png\"},{\"name\":\"Grappling Hook\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/9984591b905b66ab69c48c04e2f2829e32ffce04941b57403f1ec21c125fe573.png\"},{\"name\":\"Venom Mine\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/800b4cd6b00024479ac681dc160a50030a3883a334499da6c6918d7c239bec55.png\"},{\"name\":\"Infra-Sight\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/7f5d2bca0cdf2d33170ed1253344059db14755fc69efb524d19cebb4f3dc2903.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt86d1bcba4c0d4730/631a8a98eef3ae0e03c74392/2600_Widowmaker.jpg', 46, '[\"Circuit Royal\",\"Havana\",\"Rialto\"]'),
('Winston', 'tank', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/46a10db3aa908c590ddc4e7606376a88143d1f1306ecfbea043263040f9529a5.png', 'A super-intelligent, genetically engineered gorilla, Winston is a brilliant scientist and a champion for humanity’s potential.', '[{\"name\":\"Tesla Cannon\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/bee62b73fa25c243366aa1334aaac2d3b14b626156155895c4355dc3601ecb27.png\"},{\"name\":\"Jump Pack\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/2bdebd912f34716becf022295dd66d83abd6d156dde2aad43c87498445050f62.png\"},{\"name\":\"Barrier Projector\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/37fc72590a04cbcc4d8ddc3b839e853640a617bad0b6ce8904f6ebe8f07400ba.png\"},{\"name\":\"Primal Rage\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/3dc843c002049f4c954545f8a11570fb347caddb24365a8839563e2302a2ad7c.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltf6c81bc8f3db2ce9/631a8aa4636d390da7825dcb/2600_Winston.jpg', 47, '[\"Busan\",\"Lijiang Tower\",\"Nepal\"]'),
('Wrecking Ball', 'tank', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/9ef1d58867136e0b26f928d896000b9dab216118f6e2f59e53f2e975e1e27afa.png', 'A resourceful and highly intelligent mechanic and fighter, Wrecking Ball rose from the laboratories of Horizon Lunar Colony to become the Junker Queen’s champion.', '[{\"name\":\"Quad Cannons\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/ac31602c3ce6b5732e1730f3b9745a5d10573b819332f730f6f3f0e9cd7fffba.png\"},{\"name\":\"Grappling Claw\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/59622a0a190adb30f2ac004485b44e1956cd5fd7a984df1bb4b0e0c156878ed6.png\"},{\"name\":\"Roll\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/657f78a26e980f5fa339edb9cd318f348e00b9a0fd0079e4989584cedad40f52.png\"},{\"name\":\"Piledriver\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/dfb63a6f4f8f8e4d69109d5db9107be47deaec938b1bac6725e756b0a74b8aaa.png\"},{\"name\":\"Adaptive Shield\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/0424cbb07a23692153df454ddbab6cbd11d735a7ac4f680d449e36e49d4fbd02.png\"},{\"name\":\"Minefield\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/3477845322ea7befaff326fd662ff07eda2d7d49cb1a3518d27ec9531d10afaa.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt3ca77f61db745988/631a8a691613910e6926bfc4/2600_Wrecking_Ball.jpg', 48, '[\"Busan\",\"Lijiang Tower\",\"Samoa\"]'),
('Wuyang', 'support', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/4959500b495b35c0908be2abda56b53f2601b2c5cc39a1cfde8df1bffd38d66d.png', 'Wielder of healing technology from Wuxing University’s Water College, Wuyang is always ready to turn the tide of battle.', '[{\"name\":\"Xuanwu Staff\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/51dee96ac9a92d773bfa56a45272db8cf94ade9c051981f7a240782b0d16f8ec.png\"},{\"name\":\"Restorative Stream\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/f4d4b3abcf4581b0cfb268f571aa1e657533c294d475043b8ef0ca0d3e9696b0.png\"},{\"name\":\"Rushing Torrent\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/b545f1bee1ec06f66fee071afcece10cee6bf5f4eb2323e4daeacb7861dd8b1d.png\"},{\"name\":\"Tidal Blast\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/1c1289f947063b60cdb43226bd997557161910a3ea8f5ffcb1d1ad69e91b24b7.png\"},{\"name\":\"Guardian Wave\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/a1a3efdb2c0db62876f6e39dc82b6095a1058803e3f428ca12c912391f818d35.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltcdc9b5b3bfdd9e2c/689bc8d6a9c1ad3fc9bcb61e/2600_Aqua.png', 49, NULL),
('Zarya', 'tank', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/9b6f63cc66ddf9d5e0862173c733cc0d2e574c5c89357798d91b93b2f95a7080.png', 'Aleksandra Zaryanova is one of the world\'s strongest women, a celebrated athlete who sacrificed personal glory to protect her family, friends, and country in a time of war.', '[{\"name\":\"Particle Cannon\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/b7f554bd5736dcf6493d9ba6c4961f5b93252d692123c7d10d43a4d1b3db62c3.png\"},{\"name\":\"Particle Barrier\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/2311738a2f08aa2e72198b01ef5131337d39275fe0722143e53509592b22612a.png\"},{\"name\":\"Projected Barrier\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/80f5c53f2835ef60c6527802de36a603b90ea212af41bce469664817692fc97e.png\"},{\"name\":\"Graviton Surge\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/9a3f92c4af25b973f82ea2d8ea9a2ec266e0ccd387b053b317eb3cd977f10073.png\"},{\"name\":\"Energy\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/34d08df453dae3f8c01cabc9015e43ecfbb5fa764885a6f1f431ee90a98dcee2.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltb73df6ce7e29a4f4/631a8a606d5f7a0df8d92784/2600_Zarya.jpg', 50, '[\"King\'s Row\",\"Eichenwalde\",\"Havana\"]'),
('Zenyatta', 'support', 'https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/7d1546b1541a8afc39353f9337a408d6275a141b0432b7e560ef61579996b0fc.png', 'Zenyatta is an omnic monk who wanders the world in search of spiritual enlightenment. It is said that those who cross his path are never the same again.', '[{\"name\":\"Orb of Destruction\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/9aaea64b6fd5f024741aab112dea6ef5e3adc706af58122a6beb92505889a5f1.png\"},{\"name\":\"Orb of Discord\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/4000886b6906480f519f4a87c167bc1877b131f1dc43e8583bfc0fcf7e415904.png\"},{\"name\":\"Orb of Harmony\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/c8e37e2f3e147fde823bb9566b57e3e20d238430f0cb4f8aa8b581525a4f225e.png\"},{\"name\":\"Transcendence\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/bb8671b591d6310c3a956c354669fe8ef4b581517dea0813b5172092a8ab420c.png\"},{\"name\":\"Snap Kick\",\"icon\":\"https:\\/\\/d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net\\/overwatch\\/4bf9bae454ad8571a99b5418fe14b42b18922ca9521981797b66e9b1a9791fc7.png\"}]', 'https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltaed6928bd9793d05/631a8a573ab6f40dd2a90691/2600_Zenyatta.jpg', 51, '[\"King\'s Row\",\"Hanamura\",\"Ilios\"]');
